('Breadth/depth','Use different targets across repeats; more context switches','Repeat one easy target in all records; greater familiarity','A by allocation purpose'),
('Now/later','Transfer a result before KEEP; later verdict','Award KEEP when recipe sounds useful; immediate count','A by benefit criterion'),
