pre(1,'Preference dimensions of the current research workflow','Identify which workflow choices are settled by the supplied request and which remain unelicited.','The user’s broad requirements already favor faithful autonomous work; a preference questionnaire may add little unless it reveals a genuine trade-off.',pairs1,['Fidelity','Breadth','Autonomy','Efficient reuse','Evidence'],opts1,'Linked original records and trigger index','The first sixteen choices are supported by explicit task constraints, not newly collected user answers. Preference strength outside this task is unknown. The detailed record versus compact index choice is context-dependent: discovery uses the record, reuse uses the index.','The explicit task profile is sharper, but no new personal preferences were elicited and the current workflow remains selected.')
